    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BUILD. FIGHT. EXPLORE\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A distant planet. A relentless alien threat. And only your ingenuity stands between survival and extinction. <i>Astrosembler</i> is a sci-fi sandbox factory building strategic fps game where you build automated factories, reinforce outposts, and battle extraterrestrial forces in a hostile world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Assemble, optimize, and defend your industrial empire \u2014 because every structure, every bullet, and every resource counts. Will you rise to the challenge?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BUILD ADVANCED PRODUCTION CHAINS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3390830/extras/fb2633fd195b9606f0289ddc55910ea3.poster.avif?t=1743935903\" width=590 height=178 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3390830/extras/fb2633fd195b9606f0289ddc55910ea3.webm?t=1743935903\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3390830/extras/fb2633fd195b9606f0289ddc55910ea3.mp4?t=1743935903\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Construct and optimize production chains to manufacture weapons, defenses, and resources. Every building consumes computational power, making expansion a strategic challenge.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FIGHT BACK TO DYNAMIC AI</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3390830/extras/d73f878a2f3e8ab176e2f12269d786bc.poster.avif?t=1743935903\" width=620 height=178 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3390830/extras/d73f878a2f3e8ab176e2f12269d786bc.webm?t=1743935903\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3390830/extras/d73f878a2f3e8ab176e2f12269d786bc.mp4?t=1743935903\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defend your factory from an ever-adapting alien threat that targets weak points in your defenses.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DEEP WEAPON CRAFTING SYSTEM</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3390830/extras/bd9b05ef115d173a4080f032f9aca295.poster.avif?t=1743935903\" width=620 height=178 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3390830/extras/bd9b05ef115d173a4080f032f9aca295.webm?t=1743935903\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3390830/extras/bd9b05ef115d173a4080f032f9aca295.mp4?t=1743935903\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tinker, craft, and experiment with an extensive arsenal of weapons. Inspired by ARPG systems, <i>Astrosembler</i> lets you fine-tune your firepower with unique modifiers, attachments, and materials.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EXPANSIVE PASSIVE RESEARCH TREE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3390830/extras/db8ee98d826d732e3edbdbd2eddeb3c7.poster.avif?t=1743935903\" width=588 height=178 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3390830/extras/db8ee98d826d732e3edbdbd2eddeb3c7.webm?t=1743935903\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3390830/extras/db8ee98d826d732e3edbdbd2eddeb3c7.mp4?t=1743935903\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock powerful upgrades as your industry grows. This massive tree evolves over time, offering new technologies and gameplay-changing enhancements as you expand your operations.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EXPLORE RESOURCH RICH, HOSTILE WORLD</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3390830/extras/dd4a3a5b756334d4498861eeaf2ae76f.poster.avif?t=1743935903\" width=620 height=178 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3390830/extras/dd4a3a5b756334d4498861eeaf2ae76f.webm?t=1743935903\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3390830/extras/dd4a3a5b756334d4498861eeaf2ae76f.mp4?t=1743935903\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Discover and exploit rifts of alien minerals, but beware \u2014 the planet reacts to your industrial expansion.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >STRATEGIC PROGRESSION</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3390830/extras/732c0aa970a4d6d57f746e61a7fbf057.poster.avif?t=1743935903\" width=620 height=178 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3390830/extras/732c0aa970a4d6d57f746e61a7fbf057.webm?t=1743935903\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3390830/extras/732c0aa970a4d6d57f746e61a7fbf057.mp4?t=1743935903\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Unlock advanced technology, adapt your tactics, and make tough decisions designed to reward both creativity and efficiency.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EXPANSIVE SANDBOX WITH CHALLENGES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3390830/extras/eb2cc889bb1e6de546c6536846d74051.poster.avif?t=1743935903\" width=620 height=178 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3390830/extras/eb2cc889bb1e6de546c6536846d74051.webm?t=1743935903\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3390830/extras/eb2cc889bb1e6de546c6536846d74051.mp4?t=1743935903\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play your way: experiment with new layouts, optimize production, and defend against ever-growing alien incursions.</p>",
